  "job_B8.1.4.3_20251003_114813": {
    "chunk_text": "fiftan geare. Ne ete ge blod, ne ne gyman hwata ne swefna. Ne ge eow ne efesion, ne beard ne sceron. Ne l\u00e6t \u00f0u \u00feine dohtor beon myltestre, \u00fee l\u00e6s \u00f0in land sy mid mane gefylled. Ne gym \u00f0u drycr\u00e6fta ne galdra. Arwur\u00f0e ealdne man & ondr\u00e6d \u00fee \u00f0inne God. Ne hyrwe ge utancymene man, ac si he gemang eow swa inlendisc, & lufia\u00f0 hine swa eow sylfe, for Habba\u00f0 rihtne anmittan, & emne w\u00e6ga & emne gemetu & sestras: ic eom Drihten, eower God, \u00fee Healda\u00f0 mine bebodu & mine domas. Gyf \u00e6nig man gelyfe on Moloches hearh, swelte he dea\u00f0e; h\u00e6ne hine man mid stanum. Gyf hwa wirig\u00f0 his f\u00e6der & his modor, he sceal sweltan. Se man \u00fee bega wiccecr\u00e6ft, swelte he dea\u00f0e. Drihten spr\u00e6c to Moyse, & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: Sege Israhela folce; \u00feis synd \u00f0a dagas, \u00f0e ge sceolon Drihtne On \u00f0am feowerteo\u00f0an d\u00e6ge \u00fees forman mon\u00f0es on \u00e6fen bi\u00f0 Drihtnes f\u00e6reld. & \u00f0onne ge in cuma\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00fee ic eow sylle, ne ripe ge to cl\u00e6ne, ne ge ne gaderian \u00f0a ear \u00fee Sum Egyptisc man gestrynde sunu be Israheliscon wife onmang Israhela folce; \u00fea flat he wi\u00f0 anne \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Drihten to Moyse: L\u00e6d ut \u00feone hyruwend wi\u00f0utan \u00fea wicstowe, & setton ealle \u00f0a \u00fee his Se \u00f0e man ofslyh\u00f0 o\ufffd",
